## Overview
AmritKaurOS v5 is a privacy-first, local-first prototype built for personal / private use.
It is Punjabi-first and Naam-rooted: conversational console, Naam Tree visualization, healing audio, code companion, and encrypted memory export/import.

> **Important:** Keep this repository **PRIVATE**. This project stores sensitive personal memory data locally (localStorage) and supports encrypted exports. Do **not** enable public GitHub Pages for this repo unless you intentionally make it public.

## What's inside
- `index.html` — Punjabi console + Naam Tree + code companion + TTS demo
- `style.css`
- `app.js` — client-only logic (conversation seeds, code runner, Web Crypto encrypt/decrypt)
- `memory.json` — sample memory
- `assets/healing.mp3` — placeholder (replace with real audio file)
- `assets/naam_tree.png` — placeholder image
- `README.md` — this file

